# Week 06 - FinTrust Cloud Portfolio

## Overview

This repository contains the deliverables, notes, architecture artifacts, Python exercises, and SQL exercises completed during Week 06 of the FinTrust Cloud Portfolio learning journey.

The content focuses on:

- Security architecture design
- Identity and Access Management (IAM)
- Incident response planning
- SQL Window Functions
- Python programming exercises
- SQL development exercises

---

