Contains study materials, summaries, and design documentation.

| File | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `Comprehensive Lesson_ SQL Window Functions.pdf` | Detailed learning material covering SQL Window Functions. |
| `FinTrust_security_services_configuration_summary.pdf` | Summary of security service configurations used within the FinTrust environment. |
| `IAM_design_decision.pdf` | Documentation of Identity and Access Management design decisions. |
| `week_6_FinTrust_security_architecture_summary.pdf` | Summary of the Week 06 security architecture activities and findings. |
| `window_functions_master_class.md` | Markdown notes and examples on SQL Window Functions. |

